        {
          "@type": "DataDownload",
          "name": "trustees.json",
          "encodingFormat": "application/json",
          "contentUrl": "https://data.rcsd.info/json/trustees.json",
          "_metadata": {
            "source": "https://www.rcsdk8.net/our-district/our-board-of-trustees/meet-the-trustees",
            "scrapedAt": null,
            "method": "Manually extracted from the official RCSD 'Meet the Trustees' page and district news releases. Officer roles, trustee-area numbers, school/area assignments, emails, and term-expiration years are stated verbatim on the source page. Superintendent succession is complete: Dr. Baker retired 2026-06-30 and Dr. Rubalcaba, appointed 2026-01-21, took office 2026-07-01 and is the sitting superintendent named on the Office of the Superintendent page. Baker is retained under superintendent.former for history and is not rendered. Cabinet and director names/titles are taken from the Office of the Superintendent page, which lists each person as a Name-pipe-Title heading. Headshots mirrored from the RCSD Finalsite CDN to R2 (data.rcsd.info/trustees/)."
          }
        },
        {
          "@type": "DataDownload",
          "name": "freshness.json",
          "encodingFormat": "application/json",
          "contentUrl": "https://data.rcsd.info/json/freshness.json",
          "_metadata": {
            "source": "https://www.rcsdk8.net/our-programs-and-services/our-superintendent",
            "scrapedAt": "2026-09-21T21:50:42.732Z",
            "method": "Direct HTTPS fetch of the district and per-school Finalsite pages, no JS execution. People are extracted structurally from \"<h2>Name | Title</h2>\" headings; the person titled exactly \"Principal\" (or \"Superintendent\") is taken as the officeholder. Courtesy titles (Mr./Mrs./Ms.) are dropped and post-nominals ignored for comparison; earned doctorates are preserved. A source that 404s or whose markup no longer matches is recorded in lastRun.failures and fails the run rather than being silently skipped. CDE year availability is a range-limited GET per candidate year, judged on whether the response carries rows beneath its header (DataQuest answers 200 for any year)."
          }
        }
      ]
    },
